MangoMamba Training

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --data_dir DIR        path to dataset

Dataset parameters:
  --train-split NAME    dataset train split (default: train)
  --val-split NAME      dataset validation split (default: val)
  --test-split NAME     dataset test split (default: test)

Model parameters:
  --model MODEL         Name of model to train
  --num-classes N       number of disease classes
  --input-size N N N N N N N N N
                        Input image dimensions (d h w)
  --crop-pct N          Input image center crop percent
  -b N, --batch-size N  Input batch size for training
  --grad-accum-steps N  Gradient accumulation steps (effective batch size =
                        batch_size * grad_accum_steps)
  --mixer-mode {hybrid,pure_mamba,pure_lka}
                        Mixer mode: hybrid (default), pure_mamba, or pure_lka
  --use-eca             Use Efficient Channel Attention (ECA)
  --use-grn             Use Global Response Normalization (GRN)
  --use-swiglu          Use SwiGLU activation in MLP (default: standard GELU
                        MLP)
  --window-size N N N N N N N N N N N N N N N N
                        Window sizes for 4 stages (default: [8,8,14,7])
  --depths N N N N N N N N N N N N N N N N
                        Number of mixer blocks in the 4 stages (default: model
                        setting)
  --inter-window-mamba-stages [STAGE ...]
                        Hybrid stage indices receiving pooled inter-window
                        Mamba

Optimizer parameters:
  --opt OPTIMIZER       Optimizer
  --lr LR               learning rate
  --weight-decay WEIGHT_DECAY
                        weight decay
  --momentum M          AdamW momentum (default: 0.9)
  --eps EPSILON         Optimizer Epsilon (default: 1e-8)
  --betas BETA BETA     Optimizer Betas (default: None, use opt default)
  --clip-grad NORM      Clip gradient norm

Learning rate schedule parameters:
  --sched SCHEDULER     LR scheduler
  --epochs N            number of epochs to train
  --warmup-epochs N     epochs to warmup LR
  --min-lr LR           lower lr bound for cyclic schedulers
  --patience-epochs N   patience epochs for early stopping (default: 20)
  --early-stopping-monitor {loss,accuracy}
                        metric to monitor for early stopping (default: loss)

Loss parameters:
  --smoothing SMOOTHING
                        Label smoothing

Augmentation parameters:
  --drop-path-rate PCT  Drop path rate
  --re-prob RE_PROB     Random-erasing probability
  --hflip HFLIP         Horizontal-flip probability
  --vflip VFLIP         Vertical-flip probability
  --color-jitter COLOR_JITTER
                        Color-jitter strength

Miscellaneous parameters:
  --seed S              random seed
  --log-interval N      how many batches to wait before logging training
                        status
  -j N, --workers N     how many training processes to use
  --amp                 use Native AMP for mixed precision training
  --output PATH         path to output folder
  --experiment NAME     name of train experiment
  --train-from-checkpoint
                        train from a pretrained checkpoint
  --checkpoint-path PATH
                        path to checkpoint file to load (e.g.,
                        ./output/model_best.pth.tar)
  --resume              restore optimizer state and epoch counter from
                        --checkpoint-path
